          <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-[#39FF14] to-[#00F0FF] filter drop-shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(57,255,20,0.4)]">Computer Graphics</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm md:text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-10 font-sans">
          A highly immersive, interactive 3D timeline exploring the symbiotic relationship between hardware leaps and graphical fidelity.
        </p>
        
        <!-- Massive CTA -->
        <a 
          href="/csarch2-virtual-exhibits/s02g4/timeline" 
